  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Making All Voices Count: A Grand Challenge for Development Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To increase transparency and accountability between citizens and governments by improving relationships and making more opportunities for dialogue between them so that up to 6 million people in up to 14 DFID priority countries are directly helped to articulate their demands to government supported by technological innovations and scaled up interventions.</narrative>
  </description>
